📓 JupyterLab

JupyterLab is an interactive coding environment.

You can:

Write Python code
       ↓
Run the code
       ↓
Analyze data
       ↓
Build ML models

The option Enable idle shutdown means:

If JupyterLab is not being used for some time, AWS can automatically shut down the idle environment.

This can help avoid unnecessary usage and possible charges. For learning, enabling idle shutdown is generally a good idea.
